# O/L Past Papers

Official Sri Lankan G.C.E. Ordinary Level question-paper and answer discovery website.

- Canonical site: https://olpastpapers.vercel.app
- Primary collection: https://olpastpapers.vercel.app/ol-past-papers/
- Official answers: https://olpastpapers.vercel.app/ol-marking-schemes/
- Source files link to the Department of Examinations Sri Lanka.
- Languages: Sinhala, English and Tamil.
- Student accounts and payment are not required.

